ategory="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-63162111-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>63162111</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1125666A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NONAKA HIROKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOYOTA MOTOR CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NONAKA, HIROKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOYOTA JIDOSHA KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NONAKA HIROKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NONAKA, HIROKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A machining device (6) for machining a workpiece by relatively rotating the workpiece and a tool (1) which comprises a revolving shaft (8) held for rotation on its own axis that is parallel with the center axis, a main shaft (4) that is eccentric with respect to the center axis of the revolving shaft (8) and that rotates on its own axis that is parallel with the center axis of the revolving shaft (8), the main shaft having either the workpiece or the tool (1) mounted on the front end thereof, and rotation drive mechanisms (M1, M3) for rotating the revolving shaft (8) and main shaft (4) at different rpm's.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif d'usinage (6) servant à usiner une pièce de travail par rotation relative de celle-ci, ainsi qu'un outil (1) comprenant un arbre tournant (8) maintenu aux fins de rotation sur son axe, cet axe étant parallèle à l'axe central, et un arbre principal (4), lequel est excentré par rapport à l'axe central de l'arbre tournant (8) et peut tourner sur son axe qui est parallèle à celui de l'arbre (8). Sur l'extrémité antérieure de l'arbre principal, on a monté soit la pièce de travail, soit l'outil (1), des mécanismes de mise en rotation (M1, M3) étant destinés à faire tourner l'arbre tournant (8) et l'arbre principal (4) à des régimes différents.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>